on devices you own or control, without a fee. You may use it to play the
game and develop, test, and run compatible plugins, including commercial
plugins. Private inspection and modification for local testing are allowed.

2. Distribution and derivatives
Without prior written permission from Teirdalin, you may not redistribute,
